  "title": "Easy Hamantaschen",
  "description": "Hamantaschen are triangular-shaped orange-flavored cookies filled with your favorite jam that are always a treat for the Jewish holiday of Purim!",
  "authors": [
    "Sharon D"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:07:07-04:00",
